# Scacelith - Italiano
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one|other (1 is singular,
# 0 takes the plural: "0 mosse").
# Register: informal "tu" everywhere (as Italian Microsoft, Apple and Google software); buttons are
# tu-imperatives or nouns in sentence case; titles in capitals keep their accents (È, PIÙ).
# The player's gender is unknown: no adjective or participle agrees with the player ("Accesso
# effettuato come {0}", never "connesso come"). Chess terms follow the it glossary: donna, alfiere,
# patta, stallo, arrocco, formulario, cadenza, allenatore; notation letters R D T A C.
# Typography: apostrophe ’, quotes « », decimal comma, "85%", dates dd/mm/yyyy.

